SUMMARY:2026 Gala
DESCRIPTION:Gala Live Auction & Dinner\nSaturday\, June 6 | 5–9pm\nJoin us for an elegant evening celebrating art and philanthropy. This unforgettable night will include: \nLive Auction: Bid on unique works of art and once-in-a-lifetime experiences during the centerpiece of the evening. \nDinner by Celine and Company Catering: Delight in a delicious meal crafted by Asheville’s renowned catering team. \nSignature Cocktails & Full Bar: Enjoy our signature drinks and a full bar to toast the occasion. \nFund the Need: Help us meet critical fundraising goals to support the Museum’s programs and initiatives. \nBuy Tickets \nTogether\, these events will showcase the vibrant creativity of our community while raising vital funds to support the Museum. Don’t miss this chance to celebrate and make an impact!
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/2026-gala-2/
LOCATION:Asheville Art Museum\, 2 South Pack Square\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
